      ],
      "content": "LYE GREEN ROAD 1. 967                                            No 45                                            (Codmore Farmhouse) SP 90 SE 5/97               l.11.51. II                          GV 2. C15 altered C17.  Timber frame, whitewashed brick nogging and cement rendering, tiled roof.  Originally a hall house, now with 1st floor.  Casement windows. Diagonal shafts to chimney stack.  Interior retains carved mouldings to original roof truss.  VCH Bucks, III, 205.  RCHM Bucks, I, 97-8. Codmore Farmhouse and barns form a group. Listing NGR: SP9710602381"
    }
